    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A two-day conference was organised by the Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED), at the University's Karimabad campus, on March 31 and April 1, 2001. The conference, held in collaboration with the British Council Karachi, focussed on 'Creating Effective Leadership for Schools'.",
